{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>You shall burn with fire</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the other two: ואת מרכבותיהם תשרף באש in Joshua, and ואת העיר הזאת תשרף באש concerning Zedekiah — that the merit of the sacrifices stood for Joshua to defeat the nations, but when the sacrifices were annulled, when they besieged Jerusalem, the city was destroyed — and this is ואת העיר הזאת תשרף באש."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:39.947869104Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}